  m_text: "\u201CI drift from a half-remembered dream\u2026\u201D\n\nMy eyes trace
    the endless expanse before me. Was I asleep or dreaming? Nothing feels real\u2026
    and yet, I\u2019m here.\n\nI have to find a way out."
